{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "totalVI 的输入是 RNA 与蛋白的 UMI 计数矩阵，批次协变量是可选的整合输入。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "The input to totalVI consists of the matrices of RNA and protein unique molecular identifier (UMI) counts (Fig. 1a). Categorical covariates such as experimental batch or donor are optional inputs used for integrating datasets and referred to henceforth as “batch”."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "来源明确允许输入数据集使用不同抗体面板，并且其中一部分可以是完全没有蛋白的 scRNA-seq 数据集。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Input datasets can have different antibody panels, and a subset can be scRNA-seq datasets (i.e., without proteins)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "训练过程被调整为按批次处理蛋白缺失，蛋白特征的缺失取决于批次索引，而不是要求每个细胞都有蛋白测量。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Here we adapted the training procedure from [65] to handle missing protein data. As any single batch may correspond to an experiment that used a different protein panel (or no proteins in the case of a scRNA-seq experiment), the missingness of protein features depends on the batch index sn."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "该缺失蛋白处理还假设所有批次共享同一组基因，并且似然只对每个细胞实际观测到的 RNA 和蛋白部分进行分解。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Further, suppose all batches share the same set of genes. Across all batches, there are T proteins. For cell n, we denote the observed protein expressions ynobs and the unobserved protein expressions ynmis. The log likelihood of the observed data decomposes as\n(11)logpv(x1:N,y1:Nobs,s1:N)=∑n=1Nlogpv(xn,ynobs|sn)"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的条件与来源描述的模式一致：一个 CITE-seq 批次有蛋白，另一个 scRNA-seq 批次没有蛋白，且 RNA 都是 UMI 计数。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:rna_data_type",
        "user:batch_composition",
        "user:protein_missing_in_scrna"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "但以上来源片段属于未定论的证据缺口提醒，不代表已批准的科学断言，也不能据此认定在你的具体数据上一定适配或成功。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Input datasets can have different antibody panels, and a subset can be scRNA-seq datasets (i.e., without proteins)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "还需要确认两个批次是否共享同一组基因；如果基因集合不一致，来源中按批次缺失蛋白的似然分解条件就不满足。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "两个批次是否共享完全相同的基因集合？",
    "missing_field": "shared_gene_set",
    "why_needed": "来源中的缺失蛋白处理明确假设所有批次共享同一组基因；若不满足，则不能按该条件判断 totalVI 的适配性。"
  }
}
